(paprika, for Mashed potatoes layer)
(butter, for Beef layer) 1 tbsp
(beef, ground, for Beef layer) 1 lb
(onion, diced, for Beef layer) 1
(soya sauce, for Beef layer) 1 tbsp
(herbs de provence, for Beef layer) 1 tbsp
